      "created_at": "2016-02-09T04:33:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Setup is not bad, if a little bland. &nbsp;Since there doesn't appear to be a card game convention, &gt;Games should invent one for the game. &nbsp;<em>Powerbase&nbsp;</em>has a nice ring to it, and ties in with the hero's abilities. &nbsp;You can build or grow your powerbase. &nbsp;Conversely, your powerbase can be reduced or destroyed.</p>",
